WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.634
♪♪

00:00:05.634 --> 00:00:08.734
Narrator: THOUSANDS OF YEARS
AGO, OUR EARLIEST ANCESTORS

00:00:08.734 --> 00:00:10.701
MIGHT HAVE PICKED UP
A POINTED ROCK

00:00:10.701 --> 00:00:13.634
AND SPUN IT BETWEEN THEIR HANDS
TO BORE A HOLE

00:00:13.634 --> 00:00:16.033
IN SOMETHING
THEY WANTED TO MODIFY.

00:00:16.033 --> 00:00:20.033
TODAY, YOU CAN BUY DRILL BITS
IN ALL SHAPES AND SIZES.

00:00:25.033 --> 00:00:28.200
DRILL BITS ARE OFTEN ASSOCIATED
WITH CARPENTRY,

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:30.767
BUT FROM ELECTRONICS
TO SURGERY TOOLING,

00:00:30.767 --> 00:00:32.234
THERE ARE ALL KINDS OF FIELDS

00:00:32.234 --> 00:00:37.234
THAT REQUIRE ULTRA-THIN,
HIGH-PERFORMANCE DRILL BITS.

00:00:37.234 --> 00:00:39.467
THE PRODUCTION PROCESS BEGINS
WITH LENGTHS

00:00:39.467 --> 00:00:42.801
OF 100% CARBIDE
CALLED BLANKS.

00:00:42.801 --> 00:00:46.734
♪♪

00:00:46.734 --> 00:00:48.100
A DIAMOND GRINDING WHEEL

00:00:48.100 --> 00:00:51.167
LUBRICATED WITH A SPECIALIZED
CUTTING LIQUID

00:00:51.167 --> 00:00:54.934
IS APPLIED TO A CHAMFERED EDGE
ON ONE TIP OF THE BLANK.

00:00:57.534 --> 00:00:59.701
THIS STEP REMOVES
THE ROUGH EDGES LEFT

00:00:59.701 --> 00:01:02.100
WHEN THE BLANKS
WERE CUT DOWN TO SIZE.

00:01:02.100 --> 00:01:05.601
♪♪

00:01:05.601 --> 00:01:11.367
A VIBRATING DEVICE ORGANIZES THE
BLANKS INSIDE A ROTATING BOWL.

00:01:11.367 --> 00:01:14.968
THE VIBRATING ACTION SHIFTS
THE BLANKS INTO SINGLE FILE

00:01:14.968 --> 00:01:18.000
SO THEY CAN PROCEED
ONE-BY-ONE TO THE NEXT STEP.

00:01:20.133 --> 00:01:23.534
THIS MACHINE IS CALLED
A CENTERLESS GRINDER.

00:01:23.534 --> 00:01:26.734
THE BLANKS MOVE BETWEEN
TWO ROTATING DRUMS,

00:01:26.734 --> 00:01:29.901
WHICH GRINDS THEM DOWN
TO A SPECIFIED LENGTH.

00:01:29.901 --> 00:01:34.601
♪♪

00:01:34.601 --> 00:01:36.634
THE BLANKS POUR OUT
OF THE MACHINE

00:01:36.634 --> 00:01:39.367
IMMERSED IN THE
LUBRICATING FLUID.

00:01:39.367 --> 00:01:42.000
AN OPERATOR SELECTS ONE
AND PLACES IT

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:44.400
IN A QUALITY CONTROL GAUGE
TO CHECK

00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:47.868
THAT IT MEETS THE MANUFACTURER'S
REQUIRED TOLERANCES.

00:01:47.868 --> 00:01:53.634
♪♪

00:01:53.634 --> 00:01:56.767
THE BLANKS NOW ENTER
A CNC ROLLOMATIC.

00:01:58.734 --> 00:02:02.868
AN OPERATOR SETS UP THE TOOL
AND PROGRAMS ITS WORK PROCESS.

00:02:05.167 --> 00:02:08.567
A ROBOTIC AUTO-FEEDER PICKS UP
THE BLANKS ONE-BY-ONE

00:02:08.567 --> 00:02:10.467
FROM A SPECIALIZED PALETTE.

00:02:12.534 --> 00:02:15.200
THE ROBOTIC ARMS PLACES
EACH BLANK CAREFULLY

00:02:15.200 --> 00:02:18.834
AND PRECISELY
IN A WAITING CHUCK, OR COLLAR,

00:02:18.834 --> 00:02:21.200
AND THEN MOVES THEM
BACK INTO POSITION.

00:02:23.667 --> 00:02:27.534
THE TOOL MOVES FORWARD, HOLDING
THE BLANK PERFECTLY STILL

00:02:27.534 --> 00:02:29.667
AS A PAIR OF WHEELS CLOSE IN.

00:02:31.434 --> 00:02:34.000
LIQUID COOLANT POURS
OVER THE BLANK

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:36.167
AS THE WHEELS PRECISION
PINCH-GRIND

00:02:36.167 --> 00:02:37.868
THE TIP OF THE BLANK,

00:02:37.868 --> 00:02:40.968
GRINDING IT DOWN TO ABOUT
1/10 OF A MILLIMETER --

00:02:40.968 --> 00:02:43.100
THE WIDTH OF A HUMAN HAIR.

00:02:43.100 --> 00:02:45.267
IT'S A DELICATE PROCESS.

00:02:45.267 --> 00:02:48.667
THE ROLLOMATIC PRODUCES
48 PIECES PER HOUR.

00:02:51.200 --> 00:02:57.467
NEXT, A TECHNICIAN PLACES SMALL
SHEETS OF PLASTIC FOIL IN A JIG.

00:02:57.467 --> 00:02:59.267
THE FOIL IS SHIM STOCK,

00:02:59.267 --> 00:03:02.067
COLOR-CODED
ACCORDING TO ITS THICKNESS.

00:03:02.067 --> 00:03:06.100
THE JIG RAISES THE METAL SUPPORT
TO A SPECIFIED HEIGHT.

00:03:06.100 --> 00:03:08.601
WHEN THE BLANK ADVANCES
OVER THE SUPPORT,

00:03:08.601 --> 00:03:10.634
A MARK LEFT IN THE BLUE
INK DETERMINES

00:03:10.634 --> 00:03:12.667
WHETHER THE METAL BLANK
IS CENTERED.

00:03:14.901 --> 00:03:18.400
ONCE COMPLETE, A TECHNICIAN USES
A MAGNIFYING TOOL

00:03:18.400 --> 00:03:20.767
TO FINE-TUNE
THE PLACEMENT OF THE BLANK

00:03:20.767 --> 00:03:23.868
AND ENSURE THAT
IT'S PERFECTLY CENTERED.

00:03:23.868 --> 00:03:27.334
THIS PROCESS CAN TAKE FOUR
TO FIVE HOURS.

00:03:29.367 --> 00:03:32.968
THE BLANK IS FINALLY READY FOR
THE CRUCIAL FLUTING PROCESS

00:03:32.968 --> 00:03:36.534
THAT WILL TRANSFORM IT FROM
A CYLINDRICAL LENGTH OF CARBIDE

00:03:36.534 --> 00:03:40.400
WITH A NARROW TIP
INTO A MICRO DRILL BIT.

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:42.367
AFTER HOURS OF PREPARATION,

00:03:42.367 --> 00:03:45.834
THIS OPERATION TAKES
JUST A FEW SECONDS.

00:03:45.834 --> 00:03:48.234
AN INDUSTRIAL GRINDING
DIAMOND WHEEL

00:03:48.234 --> 00:03:52.300
HAS SLICED A MICROSCOPIC GROOVE
AT A PRECISE ANGLE.

00:03:52.300 --> 00:03:55.534
THE TECHNICIAN INSERTS THE BIT,
SHARP-END FIRST,

00:03:55.534 --> 00:03:58.367
INTO A PRECISION
MACHINING DEVICE.

00:03:58.367 --> 00:04:00.834
A STEEL BUSHING
WITH A BRASS INSERT

00:04:00.834 --> 00:04:03.200
HOLDS THE TIP OF THE BIT
IN PLACE

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:06.167
AS A CUTTING WHEEL SLICES
AN ANGLED POINT.

00:04:06.167 --> 00:04:10.000
♪♪

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:13.434
IT'S IMPOSSIBLE TO SEE THE
DIFFERENCE BETWEEN A BIT BEFORE

00:04:13.434 --> 00:04:15.868
AND AFTER FLUTING.

00:04:15.868 --> 00:04:18.968
USING A MAGNIFYING DEVICE,
THE TECHNICIAN CONDUCTS

00:04:18.968 --> 00:04:21.734
A QUALITY CONTROL
CHECK OF THE BIT.

00:04:21.734 --> 00:04:24.767
AS THE SCREEN REVEALS
THE FINELY-CUT FLUTE,

00:04:24.767 --> 00:04:27.767
THE TECHNICIAN ENSURES
THE TOOL'S PARAMETERS MEET

00:04:27.767 --> 00:04:30.067
MANUFACTURING STANDARDS.

00:04:30.067 --> 00:04:33.501
ONCE SUCH PARAMETER HAS TO DO
WITH THE SHAPE OF THE FLUTE,

00:04:33.501 --> 00:04:35.400
WHICH HAS A FORWARD TAPER.

00:04:35.400 --> 00:04:38.167
THIS MEANS THE FLUE GROOVE
BECOMES SHALLOWER

00:04:38.167 --> 00:04:42.400
FROM TIP TO BASE AT
A VERY PRECISE ANGLE.

00:04:42.400 --> 00:04:45.801
THIS FEATURE SIMULTANEOUSLY
STRENGTHENS THE TOOL

00:04:45.801 --> 00:04:50.367
WHILE INCREASING THE CHIP FLOW
ALONG THE GROOVE.

00:04:50.367 --> 00:04:53.234
ALTHOUGH CARBIDE
IS INCREDIBLY STRONG,

00:04:53.234 --> 00:04:55.667
WHEN IT'S MILLED TO
THE THICKNESS OF A HUMAN HAIR,

00:04:55.667 --> 00:04:57.267
IT BECOMES FRAGILE.

00:04:57.267 --> 00:04:58.601
NEEDLESS TO SAY,

00:04:58.601 --> 00:05:01.968
CAREFUL PACKAGING
IS EXTREMELY IMPORTANT.

